  "body": "Some homes simply make everyday life easier - and 28 Hinonga Loop is one of them.\r\nModern, affordable, low-maintenance and brilliantly positioned in the heart of Millwater, this 2022-built freehold townhouse is the kind of home that fits neatly around a busy lifestyle. And for young families, there's an extra bonus that's hard to beat: daycare is right next door, making those morning drop-offs about as easy as they come.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is light, modern and surprisingly spacious, with three bedrooms all upstairs, giving everyone their own space. Downstairs the main living areas extend to a private deck, two bathrooms add an extra layer of practicality and a heat pump keeps things comfortable year-round.\r\n\r\nWith parks, walkways and local amenities close by, Silverdale's shopping, cafes and everyday essentials just minutes away, and motorway access making commuting straightforward, this is a location designed for convenience.\r\n\r\nDaycare next door. Shops nearby. Parks close. The motorway within easy reach. It's the kind of setup that takes some of the daily juggle out of life.\r\n\r\nWhy you'll love it:\r\n* 2022-built, modern and low maintenance\r\n* Autoclaved Aerated Concrete Construction\r\n* Light-filled open-plan living\r\n* Modern kitchen with quality appliances\r\n* Seamless flow to a private deck\r\n* Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n* Freehold title\r\n* Designated off-street car park\r\n* Daycare conveniently located next door\r\n* Parks, walkways and amenities close by\r\n* Easy access to Silverdale and the motorway\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, looking for an easy-care base for a young family, downsizing without compromising on modern comforts, or adding a smart property to your portfolio, this is a home that makes a lot of sense.\r\n\r\nLow maintenance, high convenience and ready for its next chapter. Come and see why 28 Hinonga Loop deserves a closer look.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/RV1L\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
